+/*
+ * AFBD geometry words. Both formulas reproduce the two register sets that are
+ * known good byte for byte: the 1280x720 pair this driver shipped with
+ * (0x02cf04ff / 0x002c004f) and the 1920x1080 pair the MIPS firmware programs
